#: ../../tools/fatcat_tools.rst:32 af33a8b2257c4228927875edc104dbad
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search Internet Archive Scholar via Fatcat releases "
"search and retrieve detailed metadata including authors, publication "
"year, DOI, journal, publisher, abstract, and PDF links. Fatcat is the "
"underlying database powering Internet Archive Scholar, providing access "
"to 140+ million research papers and academic publications."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：通过 Fatcat 发布搜索功能检索 Internet Archive Scholar。Fatcat 是支持 Internet "
"Archive Scholar 的底层数据库，提供数百万篇研究论文和学术出版物的访问。"

#: ../../tools/fatcat_tools.rst:34 18401840430448db91dff1085887ac3d
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/fatcat_tools.rst:36 5be118c4e975472fa805e98d77a317ec
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for Fatcat releases. Use "
"keywords to search across titles, abstracts, and metadata of research "
"papers."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（必填）用于搜索Fatcat版本的查询条件。使用关键词在研究论文的标题、摘要和元数据中进行搜索。"

#: ../../tools/fatcat_tools.rst:39 260038ad74c94eebb73fa96254930896
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (required) Maximum number of results to return."
" Default is 10, maximum is 100."
msgstr "``max_results``（整数）（可选）返回的最大结果数。默认值为10，最大值为100。"

